  "psyco_waves": [
    {
      "id": "563:t_003:6",
      "english": "Kamille\n「What we call Psyco Waves in our world?」"
    },
    {
      "id": "563:t_003:14",
      "english": "Amuro\n「Neither Psyco Waves nor quantum brainwaves are special\n　powers exclusive to Newtypes or Innovators. Everyone has\n　them, though they're weak.」"
    },
    {
      "id": "599:t_022:3",
      "english": "Haman\n「It's a system that cancels the Psyco Waves controlling the\n　psycommu by hitting them with stronger waves!」"
    },
    {
      "id": "599:t_024:3",
      "english": "Haman\n「It's a system that cancels the Psyco Waves controlling the\n　psycommu by hitting them with stronger waves!」"
    },
    {
      "id": "628:t_1:147",
      "english": "$n\n「It's the ELS...! They're mimicking humans and attacking\n　people with quantum brainwaves or Psyco Waves!」"
    },
    {
      "id": "628:t_1:162",
      "english": "Cecile\n「Humans who emit Psyco Waves, such as Innovators and\n　Newtypes... The so-called humanity of a new era.」"
    },
    {
      "id": "634:t_1:111",
      "english": "Ian\n「They could certainly meet the requirement for the quantity\n　of Psyco Waves, but...」"
    },
    {
      "id": "634:t_1:134",
      "english": "Amuro\n「But humans can understand one another by using words to\n　the fullest, without Psyco Waves. So it's probably not\n　entirely wrong.」"
    }
  ],
